        zh: "韩国的初创企业生态系统正以首尔江南区德黑兰路为中心快速成长。",
        pronunciation: "hangugui seutateueop saengtaegyeneun seoul gangnamgu teheralloreul jungsimeuro ppareuge seongjanghago itda.",
        words: [{ word: "스타트업", meaning: "初创企业" }, { word: "테헤란로", meaning: "德黑兰路（首尔IT聚集地）" }],
        grammarIds: [],
