        zh: "这与其说是追求可持续增长，不如说是暗示了以快速提升企业估值为目标的投资结构。",
        pronunciation: "ineun jisok ganeunghan seongjangeul chuguhandagibodaneun ppareun gieop gachi sangseungeul mokpyoro haneun tuja gujoreul sisahanda.",
