        pronunciation: "2022nyeon simpyeongwon tonggyee ttareumyeon gungnae hanuiwon yak 1man 5cheon gosi unyeong jungigo, gungmin net jung han myeongkkolro yeon 1hoe isang hanbang jillyoreul banneunda.",
